        "subject": "=Quick idea to help {{ $json['Company Name'] }} get more meetings",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hey {{ $json['First Name'] }},\n\n{{ $json.Personalization }}\n\nI\u2019ll keep it quick \u2014 I\u2019ve been helping a few agencies fix their lead follow-ups and onboarding, and the numbers have been pretty consistent:\n\n20\u201340% more meetings booked\n\n5\u201312 hours/week saved\n\nMuch less manual work\n\nAll I do is automate two things:\n\nLead \u2192 meeting follow-ups & scheduling\n\nClient onboarding (contracts, folders, tasks, welcome email, kickoff call)\n\nThe full setup normally costs around $2,000, but I\u2019m looking to build a case study, so I\u2019m waiving the cost entirely to demonstrate the value first \u2014 I just ask for a testimonial if (and only if) it saves you time.\n\nIf you want to take a look, here\u2019s my LinkedIn so you know who\u2019s reaching out:\nLinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/pranadir-bhagavath-sena-reddy-bakaram-253572251/\n\nHappy to share more details if you're interested.\n\nBest,\nPranadir",
